# Equation sources for boost/startup.md — rendered into startup.assets/eq-*.svg

name: net-charge
tex: \Delta V_C\big|_{\text{one cycle}} = \frac{1}{C}\int_0^T i_C\,dt \;\neq\; 0 \quad(\text{start-up}) \qquad\qquad \frac{1}{C}\int_0^T i_C\,dt = 0 \quad(\text{steady state})
---
name: ipk
tex: I_{pk} = \frac{V_{in}\,D\,T}{L}, \qquad E_L = \tfrac12\,L\,I_{pk}^2
---
name: dump
tex: t_d = \frac{L\,I_{pk}}{V_C - V_{in}}, \qquad Q = \tfrac12\,I_{pk}\,t_d = \frac{L\,I_{pk}^2}{2\,(V_C - V_{in})}
---
name: energy-out
tex: E_{out} = V_C\,Q = \tfrac12\,L\,I_{pk}^2 \cdot \frac{V_C}{V_C - V_{in}} \;=\; \underbrace{\tfrac12\,L\,I_{pk}^2}_{\text{from }L} \;+\; \underbrace{V_{in}\,Q}_{\text{from the source}}
---
name: step
tex: \Delta V_C = \frac{Q}{C} = \frac{L\,I_{pk}^2}{2\,C\,(V_C - V_{in})}
---
name: step-worked
tex: I_{pk} = \frac{12 \times 5\,\mu\mathrm{s}}{300\,\mu\mathrm{H}} = 0.2\,\mathrm{A}, \qquad \Delta V_C\big|_{V_C = 58\,\mathrm{V}} = \frac{300\,\mu\mathrm{H} \times (0.2\,\mathrm{A})^2}{2 \times 20.8\,\mu\mathrm{F} \times 46\,\mathrm{V}} \approx 6\,\mathrm{mV}
---
name: sqrt-law
tex: (V_C - V_{in})\,\frac{dV_C}{dn} = \frac{L\,I_{pk}^2}{2C} \quad\Longrightarrow\quad V_C(n) = V_{in} + \sqrt{(V_0 - V_{in})^2 + n\,\frac{L\,I_{pk}^2}{C}}
---
name: ccm-balance
tex: P_{in} = V_{in}\,\bar I_L, \qquad P_{out} = \frac{V_{out}^2}{R}, \qquad (1-D)\,\bar I_L = \frac{V_{out}}{R}\quad(\text{charge balance on } C)
---
name: ccm-solve
tex: V_{in}\cdot\frac{V_{out}}{R\,(1-D)} = \frac{V_{out}^2}{R} \quad\Longrightarrow\quad V_{out} = \frac{V_{in}}{1-D}
---
name: dcm-balance
tex: \underbrace{\tfrac12\,L\,I_{pk}^2\,\frac{V_{out}}{V_{out}-V_{in}}}_{\text{energy in per cycle}}\cdot f_{sw} = \underbrace{\frac{V_{out}^2}{R}}_{\text{power out}}
---
name: dcm-solve
tex: V_{out}^2 - V_{in}V_{out} - \frac{R\,V_{in}^2 D^2 T}{2L} = 0 \quad\Longrightarrow\quad V_{out} = \frac{V_{in}}{2}\left(1 + \sqrt{1 + \frac{2\,D^2 R\,T}{L}}\right)
---
name: dcm-boundary
tex: \text{DCM when}\quad R > R_{crit} = \frac{2L}{T\,D\,(1-D)^2} = \frac{2 \times 300\,\mu\mathrm{H}}{10\,\mu\mathrm{s} \times 0.5 \times 0.25} = 480\,\Omega
---
name: precharge
tex: v_C(t) = V_{in}\,\big(1 - \cos\omega_r t\big), \qquad i_L(t) = V_{in}\sqrt{\frac{C}{L}}\,\sin\omega_r t, \qquad \omega_r = \frac{1}{\sqrt{LC}}
---
name: precharge-worked
tex: \hat v_C = 2V_{in} = 24\,\mathrm{V}, \qquad \hat I = 12\,\mathrm{V}\sqrt{\frac{20.8\,\mu\mathrm{F}}{300\,\mu\mathrm{H}}} = 3.2\,\mathrm{A}, \qquad \frac{\pi}{\omega_r} = 250\,\mu\mathrm{s}
---
name: avg-model
tex: L\,\frac{d\bar i_L}{dt} = V_{in} - (1-D)\,\bar v, \qquad C\,\frac{d\bar v}{dt} = (1-D)\,\bar i_L - \frac{\bar v}{R}
---
name: avg-equiv
tex: i' = (1-D)\,\bar i_L \quad\Longrightarrow\quad \frac{L}{(1-D)^2}\,\frac{di'}{dt} = \frac{V_{in}}{1-D} - \bar v, \qquad C\,\frac{d\bar v}{dt} = i' - \frac{\bar v}{R}
---
name: omega
tex: L_e = \frac{L}{(1-D)^2}, \qquad \omega_0 = \frac{1}{\sqrt{L_e C}} = \frac{1-D}{\sqrt{LC}}, \qquad \zeta = \frac{1}{2R}\sqrt{\frac{L_e}{C}}, \qquad \sigma = \zeta\,\omega_0 = \frac{1}{2RC}
---
name: settle
tex: t_s \approx \frac{4}{\sigma} = 8\,RC, \qquad n_s = f_{sw}\,t_s, \qquad \frac{\hat v - V_{target}}{V_{target} - V_{start}} = e^{-\pi\zeta/\sqrt{1-\zeta^2}}
---
name: settle-worked
tex: \omega_0 = \frac{0.5}{\sqrt{300\,\mu\mathrm{H} \times 20.8\,\mu\mathrm{F}}} = 6325\,\mathrm{rad/s}\ (1.0\,\mathrm{kHz}), \quad \zeta = 0.16, \quad t_s \approx 8RC = 4\,\mathrm{ms} \approx 400\ \text{cycles}
---
name: current-limit
tex: t_{min} \approx \frac{\tfrac12\,C\,(V_{target}^2 - V_{in}^2)}{V_{in}\,I_{lim}} = \frac{C\,V_{in}\,(M^2 - 1)}{2\,I_{lim}}, \qquad M = \frac{V_{target}}{V_{in}}
---
name: rhp-zero
tex: \omega_{z} = \frac{R\,(1-D)^2}{L} = \frac{24\,\Omega \times 0.25}{300\,\mu\mathrm{H}} = 2.0\times 10^{4}\,\mathrm{rad/s}\ (3.2\,\mathrm{kHz})
---
name: rl-balance
tex: V_{in} - \bar I_L R_L - (1-D)\,V_{out} = 0, \qquad (1-D)\,\bar I_L = \frac{V_{out}}{R}
---
name: rl-result
tex: \frac{V_{out}}{V_{in}} = \frac{1}{(1-D) + \dfrac{R_L}{R\,(1-D)}} = \frac{1}{1-D}\cdot\frac{1}{1 + \dfrac{R_L}{R\,(1-D)^2}}
---
name: rl-max
tex: \frac{d}{dD}\left[(1-D) + \frac{R_L/R}{1-D}\right] = 0 \quad\Longrightarrow\quad 1-D = \sqrt{R_L/R}, \qquad M_{max} = \frac12\sqrt{\frac{R}{R_L}}
---
name: rl-meaning
tex: \frac{R_L}{R\,(1-D)^2} = \frac{\bar I_L^2\,R_L}{V_{out}^2/R} = \frac{\text{power burned in } R_L \text{ by the input current}}{P_{out}}
---
name: rl-eta
tex: \eta = \frac{V_{out}^2/R}{V_{in}\,\bar I_L} = (1-D)\,\frac{V_{out}}{V_{in}} = \frac{1}{1 + \dfrac{R_L}{R\,(1-D)^2}}
---
name: stress
tex: S = \frac{V_{sw,\max}\cdot I_{sw}}{P_{out}}: \qquad S_{boost} = \frac{V_{out}\,I_{in}}{V_{out}\,I_{out}} = \frac{1}{1-D} = M, \qquad S_{buck} = \frac{V_{in}\,I_{out}}{V_{out}\,I_{out}} = M
---
name: hv-example
tex: 12 \to 325\,\mathrm{V}: \quad D = 1 - \frac{12}{325} = 0.963, \qquad t_{off} = (1-D)\,T = 0.37\,\mu\mathrm{s}\ \text{at}\ 100\,\mathrm{kHz}, \qquad \frac{R_L}{R} \le \frac{0.05}{M^2} = 6.8\times 10^{-5}\ \ (\text{for a 5\% copper loss})
---
